# =================================================================
#               VILLAIN ADS & MUSIC USERBOT CONFIGURATION
# =================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. TELEGRAM API CREDENTIALS (Required)
# Get API_ID & API_HASH from https://my.telegram.org
# Get BOT_TOKEN from @BotFather on Telegram
